    "strName": "ItmTankStationT1",
    "strNameShort": "Tank Station",
    "strNameFriendly": "Ryokka \"GX1\" Tank Station Mk I",
    "strDesc": "Originally a project to combine an N2 canister and an RCS intake in-house to avoid subcontracting Kang, legal battles forced the GX1 to be redesigned into a compact transfer pump that empties salvaged gas canisters into the ship's own tanks. Open its hopper and insert a can, wire the unit to ship power, and set the panel to AUTO or ON: the can's contents are pumped into your installed tanks and any cans feeding your RCS intakes, stopping just short of maximum safe pressure. With DUMP MODE on (right-click the unit), a loaded can keeps draining even when your tanks are full, venting the excess.",
    "strItemDef": "ItmTankStationT1",
    "strType": "Item",
