  {
    "strName": "ItmTankStationT4",
    "strNameShort": "Tank Station",
    "strNameFriendly": "Corsair \"Vampire\" Tank Station Mk IV",
    "strDesc": "Some say this is the product of a stolen Ryokka tank station and Belt Pirate ingenuity. Others say it works on witchcraft. On top of everything the Mk III does, the Mk IV establishes a connection with any selected ship and siphons its reserves across open space. It has a short range and is best used on targets that can't fight back. However, it can be used at reduced effectiveness outside the range of sensors or guns, an ability feared by all factions across Ceres. Wire it to ship power and set the panel to AUTO or ON. With DUMP MODE on (right-click the unit), sources keep draining even when your tanks are full, venting the excess. Useful if you want to leave your target stranded in the black.",
    "strItemDef": "ItmTankStationT4",
    "strType": "Item",
    "aInteractions": [
      "Inventory",
